                              第5 章 Attribute Reference 


                  91 / 129             ADS Synthesis User Guide 
5.15 syn_preserve 

该属性用于控制是否保留在综合过程中被优化的sequential (registers).  
syn_preserve Values 
Global 
Object 
No 
module, port, register 

属性值 
作用 
0 
不保留在综合过程中被优化的registers 
1 
保留在综合过程中被优化的registers 
Syntax Specification 
verilog 
object /* synthesis syn_preserve = value */; 
Verilog Example 

module syn_preserve_1_reg (out1,out2, data, rst, clk); 

output [7:0] out1,out2; 

input [7:0] data; 

input rst,clk; 


reg [7:0] out1; 

reg [7:0] out2 /* synthesis syn_preserve=1 */; 


// create the 8-bit register 

always @(posedge clk or negedge rst ) 

begin 


if (!rst ) begin 



out1 <= 8'b0; 



out2 <= 8'b0; 


end 


else begin
